nd I mark it with my thumb.\nM3: i copy the old route twice and mark the pencil circle beside it. i leave the hand-drawn map unfinished and the pencil mark beside the old route. i put the hand-drawn map beside the old one because the new mark feels more satisfying.\nM1: i copy the old route twice and mark it beside the old one. i leave the hand-drawn map unfinished, but i write the new route beside it. i copy the old circle again, but this time i leave it beside the old one. i write the new route on the paper again, and i copy the old circle once more. i leave the hand-drawn map unfinished and write, \"i leave it beside the old one,\" on the third page. i copy\n\nIt is M2's turn. What do you do or say next?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n",
